content.prompt:
For each piecewise-defined function below:
(i) sketch the graph of $y=f(x)$;
(ii) write down the gradient along each branch of your graph;
(iii) write down the equation of the derivative as a piecewise-defined function;
(iv) sketch the graph of $y=f'(x)$ on a separate set of axes.

